@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor White
skinparam usecaseBorderColor Black
skinparam nodesep 65
skinparam ranksep 85
usecase "ros_gz_bridge::RosGzBridge" as Bridge
usecase "project1::ros2::WallFollowerNode" as Follower
usecase "robot_state_publisher::RobotStatePublisher" as State
usecase "rclcpp::Node\n(RViz display)" as Rviz
usecase "rclcpp::Node\n(image bridge)" as Image
Bridge --> Follower : /scan : LaserScan
Bridge --> Follower : /odom : Odometry
Follower --> Bridge : /cmd_vel : TwistStamped
Bridge --> State : /joint_states : JointState
State --> Rviz : /tf, /tf_static : TFMessage
Bridge --> Rviz : /scan : LaserScan
Bridge --> Rviz : /tf : TFMessage
Follower --> Rviz : /trajectory : Path
Image --> Rviz : /camera/image_raw : Image
note bottom
Same controller class and executable as physical operation.
Gazebo supplies the bridge inputs; Gazebo transport is not a ROS node.
/clock supplies simulation time to participating nodes (omitted for readability).
RViz and the image bridge use generic ROS node instances.
end note
@enduml
